                    <span >0.50 > 0.5，因為50 > 5。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >0.5 = 0.50！小數末尾加0不改變數值。0.5=5/10，0.50=50/100=5/10，兩者相等。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 小數末尾的0不影響數值大小！</div>
            </div>
